cards.rulesCore:
Kicker {R}
Menace
When this creature enters, if it was kicked, return target creature card with mana value 3 or less from your graveyard to the battlefield. It gains haste. Sacrifice it at the beginning of the next end step.

Tap up to four target creatures.
Cycling {1}{U}
When you cycle this card, you may tap target creature.

Counter target spell unless its controller pays {3}.
Cycling {2}{U}
When you cycle this card, you may counter target spell unless its controller pays {1}.

Target creature gets -4/-4 until end of turn.
Cycling {1}{B}{B}
When you cycle this card, you may have target creature get -1/-1 until end of turn.

Put four +1/+1 counters on each creature you control.
Cycling {4}{G}{G}
When you cycle this card, you may put four +1/+1 counters on target creature.

Deem Worthy deals 7 damage to target creature.
Cycling {3}{R}
When you cycle this card, you may have it deal 2 damage to target creature.

All creatures gain fear until end of turn.
Cycling {1}{B}
When you cycle this card, you may have target creature gain fear until end of turn.

Target creature gets +4/+4 until end of turn.
Cycling {2}{G}
When you cycle this card, you may have target creature get +1/+1 until end of turn.

You gain 6 life.
Cycling {1}{W}
When you cycle this card, you may gain 2 life.

Target creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn.
Cycling {5}{R}{G}{W}
When you cycle this card, target creature gets +6/+6 until end of turn.

Target player discards a card at random.
Cycling {5}{U}{B}{R}
When you cycle this card, target player discards two cards at random.

Exile target attacking creature.
Cycling {5}{G}{W}{U}
When you cycle this card, exile up to two target attacking creatures.

Resounding Thunder deals 3 damage to any target.
Cycling {5}{B}{R}{G}
When you cycle this card, it deals 6 damage to any target.

Return target permanent to its owner's hand.
Cycling {5}{W}{U}{B}
When you cycle this card, return two target permanents to their owners' hands.

Slice and Dice deals 4 damage to each creature.
Cycling {2}{R}
When you cycle this card, you may have it deal 1 damage to each creature.

Solar Blast deals 3 damage to any target.
Cycling {1}{R}{R}
When you cycle this card, you may have it deal 1 damage to any target.

Prevent the next 4 damage that would be dealt to any target this turn.
Cycling {1}{W}
When you cycle this card, you may prevent the next 1 damage that would be dealt to any target this turn.
